-- property decorator accepts: fget, fset, fdel, doc (functions to get,set,delete property)
-- properties override instance attributes if defined with the same name (properties are part of a larger category that does that **overriding descriptors**)
-- property factory -- functions to be imported across classes do define common getters and setters for same types of imputs (like prices, etc.)

